  "name": "Product URL to UGC-style vertical video ad with Sisif, Slack approval and Instagram publishing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "815ee85a-30da-4e41-b842-092356b62da1",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1900,
        -500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 600,
        "height": 1160,
        "content": "## Create UGC-style video ads from a product URL with Sisif, Slack and Instagram\n\nPaste a product page URL and get three vertical UGC-style ad variants. Your team picks one in Slack, and the approved video is published as an Instagram Reel.\n\n### Who it's for\nDTC brands, social media managers and agencies who want to test short video ads without filming.\n\n### How it works\n1. A form or webhook receives the product URL.\n2. The page is fetched and reduced to its title, description and text.\n3. An AI chain writes a hook, a script, a caption and three visual prompts.\n4. Sisif renders each prompt as a 5 second 9:16 video.\n5. Slack shows the ready variants and waits for a reviewer to pick one or reject.\n6. The chosen video becomes an Instagram Reel container and is published once processing finishes.\n\n### Setup\n- [ ] Create an account at [Sisif](https://sisif.ai/), then create a key on the [API keys page](https://sisif.ai/users/api-keys/). Save it in n8n as a **Bearer Auth** credential and select it on **Create Sisif Video** and **Check Video Status**.\n- [ ] Add an OpenAI credential on **OpenAI Chat Model**, or use another chat model.\n- [ ] Connect Slack and pick the review channel in **Ask For Approval In Slack**.\n- [ ] Add a **Facebook Graph API** credential with `instagram_basic` and `instagram_content_publish` for an Instagram Business or Creator account linked to a Facebook Page.\n- [ ] Set `ig_user_id` in **Settings**, then submit the form once to test.\n\n### Customize\n- Change the ad angles and tone in **Write Hook And Script**.\n- For JavaScript-heavy stores, replace **Fetch Product Page** with a scraping API.\n- To post to more platforms, replace the Instagram nodes with Blotato and pass `video_url` and `caption` from **Pick Approved Variant**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
